{
  "lore": "In the ancient land of Vaeloria, where the skies shimmer with the remnants of forgotten magic, a great cataclysm once shattered the world. The Celestial Convergence, a celestial event that once bound the realms of light and shadow, was broken by the fall of the Starforged, an ancient race of celestial beings who wielded power beyond mortal comprehension. Their demise left behind a fractured world, where the echoes of their power still linger in the form of the Shattered Realms—floating islands suspended in the sky, each holding a fragment of the lost knowledge and magic of the Starforged.

The Shattered Realms are not merely places, but living entities, each with its own will and purpose. Some are serene and peaceful, while others are volatile and dangerous, teeming with wild magic and ancient creatures. The people of Vaeloria, once united under the Starforged's guidance, now live in scattered enclaves, struggling to survive in a world where magic is unpredictable and the past is a mystery.

Legends speak of the last Starforged, a being known as the Keeper of the Convergence, who vanished into the void after the cataclysm. Some believe the Keeper still walks among the Shattered Realms, waiting for the right moment to restore balance. Others claim the Keeper is lost forever, their power scattered and their name erased from history. But in the shadows of the floating islands, whispers of a new convergence begin to stir, and the fate of Vaeloria hangs in the balance."
}

